{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"# MCP limb CONFIRMED end-to-end (AC2, first half) — it was static evidence, now it is measured\n\nThe ticket flagged limb 3 (MCP) as \"static evidence; this limb was not driven end-to-end and\nshould be confirmed first\". Done, against a REAL rejecting origin — no mocks.\n\nDrive: a real `rebar_repo` store; its tracker's `origin` repointed at a real local bare repo whose\nreal `pre-receive` hook declines with GH013-shaped stderr; `origin/tickets` seeded first so the\nshape is a diverging branch, not a first push. Then the MCP server was built in-process\n(`rebar.mcp_server.build_server()`) and the `comment_ticket` tool invoked through\n`srv.call_tool(...)` — the same path a writing agent takes.\n\n```\n=== MCP comment_ticket RESULT ===\n([TextContent(type='text', text='ok', annotations=None, meta=None)], {'result': 'ok'})\n=== unpushed commits origin/tickets..HEAD: 2\n```\n\n**CONFIRMED, not refuted.** The tool returned the literal `ok` — both as text content and as the\nFastMCP-derived structured `{\"result\": \"ok\"}` — while the push had really been declined and two\nticket commits were stranded locally. The writing agent reads only this result, so on the MCP\nsurface the failure is undeliverable exactly as limb 1 (async) and limb 2 (library) are. The\nserver-side `install_stderr_handler` does fire, but it writes to the SERVER's stderr, which the\nagent never sees.\n\nThis also fixes the shape of the remedy for the `-> str` write tools: FastMCP ALREADY advertises\nthem as a generic `{result: <str>}` ack, so adding `push_status` alongside `result` is a strict\nsuperset of the shape agents see today, not a new envelope.\n\nProceeding to implement the approved B4 remedy (durable marker + MCP `push_status` field) on\nworktree `lamb-push-status`."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786510789552017001,"uuid":"3bfecb11-a92c-4f52-b68d-69ffd3fc3a59"}